#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:158
msgid "Bigger sites take longer to run. This depends on your server."
msgstr "Größere Websites benötigen länger. Dies hängt von deinem Server ab."

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:159
