"Dein Server muss AVIF unterstützen. Überprüfe die Protokolle, wenn es "
"fehlschlägt."

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:162
msgid "Old Browsers:"
msgstr "Alte Browser:"

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:162
msgid "AVIF might not work on older browsers, WebP is safer."
msgstr ""
"AVIF funktioniert möglicherweise nicht in älteren Browsern, WebP ist "
"sicherer."

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:163
msgid "MIME Types:"
msgstr "MIME-Typen:"

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:163
msgid "Server must support WebP/AVIF MIME (check with host)."
msgstr "Server muss WebP/AVIF MIME unterstützen (mit Host überprüfen)."

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:164
msgid "Rollback:"
msgstr "Rückgängig:"

#: inc/ImageOptimizer/AdminPage.php:164
msgid ""
"If conversion fails, then rollback occurs, and prevents deletion of the "
"original, regardless of whether the Preserve Originals is checked or not."
